# EdminBoost QA

Three-layer local QA harness (MAMP). Full guide: `tests/README.md`.

## Layout

```
bin/
  run-phpunit.sh          # MAMP PHP wrapper
  install-wp-tests.sh     # WP test suite bootstrap
  setup-qa-site.sh        # QA users + plugin symlink
tests/
  bootstrap.php           # PHPUnit bootstrap
  wp-tests-config.php     # local DB config (gitignored; copy from .sample)
  phpunit/                # *Test.php classes
  e2e/
    playwright.config.ts
    fixtures/             # pages.ts, helpers.ts
    specs/                # *.spec.ts
  manual/
    regression-matrix.md  # post-automation checklist
    issue-template.md
.env.qa.example           # copy to .env.qa (gitignored)
phpunit.xml.dist
composer.json             # composer test
package.json              # npm run test:e2e
```

## Commands

```bash
composer install && npm install
cp .env.qa.example .env.qa
cp tests/wp-tests-config.sample.php tests/wp-tests-config.php
bash bin/setup-qa-site.sh   # one-time

composer test               # PHPUnit (uses MAMP PHP via bin/run-phpunit.sh)
npm run test:e2e            # Playwright (PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=./.playwright-browsers)
npm run test:e2e:ui         # debug UI
npm run test:e2e:report     # open HTML report
```

PHPUnit uses table prefix `wptests_` in the `wordpress` database (separate from live tables). E2E reads `.env.qa` (`BASE_URL`, `ADMIN_USER`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `EDITOR_USER`, `EDITOR_PASSWORD`, `PLUGIN_SLUG`). `PLUGIN_SLUG` must match `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG` / bootstrap filename (`edminboost-smart-admin-productivity-tool`).

## PHPUnit Patterns

- Extend `Edminboost_Test_Case` (resets options, resets CC static caches, seeds admin user, calls `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::ensure_discovery_menu_snapshot()`).
- Use `seed_settings( $overrides )` — merges with `EDMINBOOST_Settings::get_defaults()`.
- Test files: `tests/phpunit/{Settings,Features,CommandCenter,CommandCenterBar,Theme,AdminMenuOrder}Test.php`.
- Name tests `test_{behavior}`; target static helpers on bar/CC classes where hook tests are heavy.

## Playwright Patterns

- Auth: `global.setup.ts` saves `tests/e2e/.auth/admin.json` (gitignored).
- Page URLs: `fixtures/pages.ts` — built from `PLUGIN_SLUG` env var (`dashboard`, `appearance`, `billing`, `settings`, `mapper`, `presets`, `productivity`, `security`, `performance`, `white-label`; legacy `onboarding` / `behavior` for redirect tests).
- Assert plugin ready: `.edminboost-wrap[data-edminboost-ready="true"]`.
- Settings saves: `waitForSettingsSaved()` in `fixtures/helpers.ts` (URL contains `settings-updated=true`).
- Specs mirror admin pages: `dashboard` (overview pickers + inline save), `home-setup` (setup wizard / overview), `home-look` (Theme/declutter on Appearance — declutter preview at `#edminboost-declutter-preview`; panel/badge/drawer-width tests should target Top Bar / `pages.mapper`), `settings-features` (Productivity feature toggles), `layout-studio`, `presets-roles`, `live-admin-bar`.
- Config: single worker, 60s timeout, chromium only, `baseURL` from `.env.qa`.

## Rules

- Never commit `.env.qa`, `tests/wp-tests-config.php`, `tests/e2e/.auth/`, `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/`, `.playwright-browsers/`, `.phpunit.result.cache`.
- E2E selectors: prefer stable plugin IDs/classes (`#edminboost-*`, `.edminboost-*`) over wp-admin internals.
- Add PHPUnit for new sanitization/helpers (e.g. `CommandCenterTest::test_get_page_links`, `test_get_nav_items`, `test_get_billing_plans`, `test_get_role_system_presets`, `test_normalize_dashicon_class`, `test_detect_active_layout_preset`, `test_get_picker_presets`, `test_top_bar_items_match`, `test_sanitize_apply_preset_replaces_custom_menu_studio`; `SettingsTest::test_sanitize_dashboard_theme_preset_clears_stale_custom_flag`, `test_sanitize_dashboard_overview_payload_without_features`, `test_sanitize_save_custom_preset_with_name`, `test_sanitize_rename_custom_preset`; `ThemeTest` for preset catalog, custom colors, body classes, theme extras sanitize; `FeaturesTest::test_menu_studio_protected_slugs`, `test_resolve_menu_studio_for_user_preserves_custom_items`, `test_menu_studio_registers_custom_sidebar_links`, `test_menu_studio_use_colors_off_resets_colors_on_save`; `CommandCenterTest::test_get_animation_speed_options` for drawer duration helpers); add Playwright for new admin UI flows (CC tab nav, dashboard overview pickers + live theme preview, billing page, Appearance declutter preview `#edminboost-declutter-preview`, theme extras preview `#edminboost-theme-extras-preview`, Top Bar panel/badge controls `#edminboost-mapper-look`, Menu Studio layout/color live previews, form reset confirm + reload); update `tests/manual/regression-matrix.md` for manual-only checks (e.g. CC-B-02 animation speed).
- Run `composer test` and `npm run test:e2e` before shipping user-facing CC or settings changes.
